	(footprint "AQROOT_Beta:Hirose_FH69-50S-0.5SH"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "4834f2ee-e3b5-4241-9141-23d3ee467ea4")
		(at 36.5 80.15)
		(descr "Hirose FH69-50S-0.5SH, HRS No. CL0580-5008-0-00, 50-position 0.5 mm pitch FPC/FFC connector, SMT horizontal (right-angle), back-flip actuator, top-and-bottom 2-point contact, 125 C. Rated 0.5 A / 50 V AC-DC per contact. Applicable FPC/FFC t=0.30 +/-0.05 mm gold plated. LANDS ARE VENDOR-EXACT, taken from the Hirose FH69 series catalogue (Jun. 2025 issue, en_FH69_CAT) 'Recommended PCB Layout', cross-checked against specification sheet ELC-399242-00-00: signal land 0.30 +/-0.03 x 1.23 +/-0.03, pitch 0.5, contact span C = 24.5 for n=50; hold-down land 0.36 +/-0.03 x 4.25 +/-0.03, span E = 28.73 +/-0.05; overall layout depth 7.38 +/-0.05. E IS CENTRE-TO-CENTRE: on the manufacturer drawing the E extension line coincides with the hold-down dash-dot centreline, and connector dimension B (tab centres) = 28.7 agrees with E = 28.73 only on a centre reference. Vertical stack closes exactly: 1.23 + 1.90 gap + 4.25 = 7.38. PIN 1 IS AT +X, matching the 'Contact No.1' callout on the manufacturer drawing - verify orientation at placement. Hold-downs are mechanical only (unnamed pads), not a ground connection. Body outline on F.Fab is the 29.98 mm catalogue body length; the actuator-closed envelope is 8.68 +/-0.3 deep and the courtyard covers it. Recommended metal mask thickness t=0.12. No 3D model.")
		(tags "connector FPC FFC Hirose FH69 50pin 0.5mm right-angle SMT top-bottom-contact")
